  "text": "[patient] Hello doctor, I just started taking Hydralazine 25 mg three times a day yesterday. Today, I started feeling jittery with a very bad sinus pressure and a headache. My blood pressure is down to 115/75 after being at 145/93. My heart rate has increased to 90. I feel very cold like I have a fever, and a little dizzy as well. Could this be due to my medication or do I have a virus? I am also on Quinapril 40 mg twice a day and Amlodipine besylate 10 mg once a day.\n[doctor] Hello. For further queries consult an internal medicine physician online --> https://icliniq.com./ask-a-doctor-online/internal-medicine-physician",
